label opening_cutscene (Opening Cutscene)
[style name="Cutscene"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): …you heard me.
"Dianthus Core": Good. Then there is still one road left for the light to travel.
"Dianthus Core": I am Dianthus. What remains of me. My roots are torn and my petals remember a warmth I can no longer hold alone.
"Dianthus Core": Little alchemist — if my glow goes dark, the hunger beneath this soil will learn how to bloom in my place. That must not happen.
"Dianthus Core": The shadows are already pressing their mouths against the garden wall. Stay close. My light can hold them until dawn, but only just.
"Dianthus Core": Rest now. Let the petals settle around you. When the sun returns, we begin.
[signal arg="opening_cutscene_done"]
[end_timeline]
